      "url": "https://github.com/Sweenus/SimplySwords/blob/708a57bc591e0af75ae0c5ec6beb0d8ff22f67af/common/src/main/java/net/sweenus/simplyswords/client/renderer/ParchmentBoltEntityRenderer.java#L60-L84",
      "source": "private static <T extends Entity & ParchmentBoltRenderData> Vec3d resolveSmoothedOffset(T entity, float tickDelta) {\n        float ageTicks = entity.age + tickDelta;\n        Vec3d target = new Vec3d(\n                MathHelper.lerp(tickDelta, entity.prevX, entity.getX()),\n                MathHelper.lerp(tickDelta, entity.prevY, entity.getY()),\n                MathHelper.lerp(tickDelta, entity.prevZ, entity.getZ()));\n\n        RenderState state = RENDER_STATES.computeIfAbsent(entity.getId(),\n                ignored -> new RenderState(target, ageTicks));\n\n        float deltaTicks = ageTicks - state.lastAgeTicks;\n        if (deltaTicks < 0.0F || deltaTicks > 5.0F) {\n            state.position = target;\n        } else if (deltaTicks > 0.0F) {\n            state.position = state.position.lerp(target,\n                    Math.min(1.0F, POSITION_SMOOTHING_RATE * deltaTicks));\n        }\n        state.lastAgeTicks = ageTicks;\n\n        if (entity.age % 80 == 0) {\n            RENDER_STATES.entrySet().removeIf(entry ->\n                    entry.getKey() != entity.getId() && ageTicks - entry.getValue().lastAgeTicks > 100.0F);\n        }\n        return state.position.subtract(target);\n    }",
      "targetScope": "school_talisman",
      "observation": "稀疏网络位置包通过每实体RenderState缓存位置，以分数tick增量乘0.55逼近插值目标，渲染只返回平滑位置减目标的补偿，负时间/大跳时直接复位。研究符纸投射物平滑与旋转分工；静态Map仅按entityId且以各实体自身age比较清理，跨世界ID复用和不同出生时间不能当统一过期钟，缓存清理设计不可照搬。",
      "reviewMode": "MANUALLY_READ_FULL_METHOD"
